{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"lift-wait","skinId":"paperbook","adapter":"legacy","sourceHashes":{"rules":"e4a33f065ba2b37052330bb6e2035226cc5b6a54be165ce831b1a51c56530ae3","skin":"9e488d232b8c72c585b9bc0fa02ed76895994e355a606ece05c752d592345d32"},"rules":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"lift-wait","title":"电梯停住了","kind":"response","order":11,"location":"轿厢 · 故障停梯","description":"电梯停止运行，门没有打开。用报警通话装置联络，在轿厢内耐心等待。","safety":"本关无下坠、无烟火、无人受伤，报警装置有效。若联络无回应，可使用手机等通信设备求助，不扒门、不攀爬。训练计时不是救援到达时间。","briefing":"电梯停住了，门打不开。报警通话装置仍可使用；请留在轿厢内求助。","objects":[{"id":"door","label":"轿门","input":"tap"},{"id":"bell","label":"报警通话按钮","input":"tap","disabledWhen":["wait-confirmed"]},{"id":"person","label":"被困乘客","input":"drag","disabledWhen":["person-waiting"]},{"id":"floor-1","label":"楼层按钮1","input":"tap"},{"id":"floor-2","label":"楼层按钮2","input":"tap"}],"goals":[{"id":"call-started","label":"接通对讲","object":"bell"},{"id":"location-reported","label":"报告位置","object":"bell"},{"id":"alarm-contacted","label":"联络外界","object":"bell"},{"id":"person-waiting","label":"移至等待区","object":"person"},{"id":"wait-confirmed","label":"保持联系","object":"bell"}],"interactions":[{"id":"call","source":"bell","mode":"tap","grants":["call-started"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"call","feedback":"对讲已接通。请查看电梯标识，向值守人员说明你的位置。"},{"id":"report-location","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"阳光小区 · 1栋2号梯","requires":["call-started"],"unless":["location-reported"],"grants":["location-reported"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"reply","feedback":"位置已确认。接下来如实报告人数和当前状况。"},{"id":"report-status","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"1人被困，目前无人受伤","requires":["location-reported"],"unless":["alarm-contacted"],"grants":["alarm-contacted"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"reply","feedback":"值守人员：已记录位置和情况。请留在轿厢内，远离门边，保持联系。"},{"id":"wait","source":"person","mode":"drop","target":"wait","grants":["person-waiting"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"wait","feedback":"已移至远离门边的等待区。完成联络后，继续保持联系。"},{"id":"confirm-wait","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"我会保持联系，有不适及时报告","requires":["alarm-contacted","person-waiting"],"unless":["wait-confirmed"],"grants":["wait-confirmed"],"outcome":"correct","animation":"reply","feedback":"已确认继续待援。本次完成的是求助练习，不代表救援已经到达。"},{"id":"pry","source":"door","mode":"tap","grants":[],"outcome":"danger","animation":"stay-inside","feedback":"不要扒撬轿门。使用报警装置与外界联络，留在轿厢内等待。"},{"id":"leave-door","source":"person","mode":"drop","target":"door","grants":[],"outcome":"danger","animation":"stay-inside","feedback":"不要尝试从门缝离开，可能坠入井道。请留在轿厢内等候专业救援。"},{"id":"guess-location","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"看见楼层键“2”，就报告在2楼","requires":["call-started"],"unless":["location-reported"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"楼层按钮上的数字不是当前停靠位置。请按照电梯标识报告，不猜测楼层。"},{"id":"guess-status","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"不看现场，先说有人受伤","requires":["location-reported"],"unless":["alarm-contacted"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"请如实说明观察到的情况。本次模拟只有1人被困，无人受伤。"},{"id":"rush-door","source":"bell","mode":"tap","choice":"既然已联系，就到门缝旁等着出去","requires":["alarm-contacted","person-waiting"],"unless":["wait-confirmed"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"联络成功不代表已经可以离开。继续留在等待区，保持联系。"},{"id":"explain-floor-1","source":"floor-1","mode":"tap","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"楼层键没有响应。请使用带铃铛标记的报警通话按钮联络外界，不要反复尝试开门。"},{"id":"explain-floor-2","source":"floor-2","mode":"tap","grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"楼层键没有响应。请使用带铃铛标记的报警通话按钮联络外界，不要反复尝试开门。"},{"id":"contact-status","source":"bell","mode":"tap","requires":["alarm-contacted"],"unless":["wait-confirmed"],"grants":[],"outcome":"neutral","animation":"reply","feedback":"求助已经记录。请移至远离门边的等待区，并继续保持联系。"}],"risk":{"mode":"elapsed","seconds":90,"initial":0,"warningAt":65,"peakFeedback":"本关没有灾害倒数，请继续练习。"},"completion":{"requires":["call-started","location-reported","alarm-contacted","person-waiting","wait-confirmed"],"settleMs":1800,"title":"已联络，安心等待","status":"待援","summary":"普通故障被困时，用报警装置或手机与外界联络，说明位置。不要扒门、攀爬或跳跃；留在轿厢内等待专业人员救援。"},"coaching":{"tasks":["alarm-contacted","person-waiting","wait-confirmed"],"reminders":["楼层键不响应时，使用报警通话装置联络。按电梯标识报告位置，如实说明人数和状况。","不要扒门或尝试从门缝离开。把乘客移至远离门边的等待区。","联络后继续保持联系，有不适及时报告。练习用时不是救援到达时间。"],"conversations":[{"id":"location","requires":["call-started"],"unless":["location-reported"],"title":"模拟通话 · 报告位置","prompt":"值守人员：请问你被困在哪部电梯？","reference":"电梯标识：阳光小区 · 1栋2号梯。楼层按钮不是位置指示器。","choices":["report-location","guess-location"]},{"id":"status","requires":["location-reported"],"unless":["alarm-contacted"],"title":"模拟通话 · 说明状况","prompt":"值守人员：有几人被困？是否有人受伤？","reference":"本次场景：轿厢内有1名乘客，无烟火，无人受伤。","choices":["guess-status","report-status"]},{"id":"waiting","requires":["alarm-contacted","person-waiting"],"unless":["wait-confirmed"],"title":"保持联系 · 继续待援","prompt":"值守人员：已记录你的求助。请保持联系，情况有变化及时告诉我们。你会怎样回应？","reference":"你已联络外界，也已移至等待区。现在仍在待援，不代表救援已经到达。","choices":["confirm-wait","rush-door"]}]}},"skin":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"paperbook","world":{"width":720,"height":1280},"framing":{"sceneBounds":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":720,"h":1440},"critical":{"x":58,"y":226,"w":607,"h":956},"criticalRegions":[{"x":163,"y":226,"w":395,"h":530},{"x":58,"y":786,"w":220,"h":390},{"x":586.2075471698113,"y":580.3207547169811,"w":78.67924528301887,"h":82.64150943396226},{"x":327,"y":596,"w":172,"h":449.4193548387097},{"x":81,"y":719,"w":177,"h":462.48387096774195}]},"assets":{"lift-room":{"src":"/levels/display-adaptation/lift-wait-backdrop.webp","alpha":false,"sceneBounds":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":720,"h":1440}},"lift-door":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/lift-door.png","alpha":false},"intercom":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/intercom.png","alpha":true},"bell":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/bell.png","alpha":false},"citizen-worried":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-worried.png","alpha":true},"citizen-focused":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-focused.png","alpha":true},"citizen-panicked":{"src":"/levels/transcript-v1/citizen-